{"version":1,"content":"<p>正所謂：一日之計在於晨，早餐同樣是開展新一天的關鍵。</p><p>近期有網友分享一個簡單早餐組合，就是烚蛋加奇異果，更有日本女藝人實測只要照着吃一個月，就能輕鬆減掉3至6公斤，隨即引發熱議。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;烚蛋加奇異果比起一</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T08:21:47.741676+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":109,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T08:00:43+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T08:18:19.299848+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T08:18:19.299848+00:00","content_hash":"85cca8c5410295c8a96762af33bf16b51f74e1001930cd5527a3e7cebffa3111","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}